ror during AI chat qualification lookup: {}\", e.getMessage());\n+        }\n+        return List.of();\n+    }\n }\n \n[diff_block_end]\n\nPlease note that the above snippet only shows the MODIFIED lines from the last change. It shows up to 3 lines of unchanged lines before and after the modified lines. The actual file contents may have many more lines not shown.","truncated_fields":["content"]}
